{"id":"single-horn","name":{"en":"Single Horn","ja":"一本角","tc":"獨角魚","sc":"独角鱼"},"desc1":{"en":"A fish monster. The longer its horn, thelonger the specimen has lived.","ja":"「魚の魔物ね。角が長ければ長いほど、　長生きしてる個体みたい」","tc":"「這是魚魔物，似乎角越長，　就代表這隻個體活了越久喔。」","sc":"“这是鱼魔物，似乎角越长，　就代表这只个体活了越久哦。”"},"desc2":{"en":"Oh, really? Let's measure the nextone then, and take notes!","ja":"「あ、そうなんだ。じゃあ、次から角の長さを　測って、メモしておこーっと！」","tc":"「啊，是這樣呀。那下次遇到，　就測量一下角的長度，記錄下來吧！」","sc":"“啊，是这样呀。那下次遇到，　就测量一下角的长度，记录下来吧！”"},"char1":"liane","char2":"firis","kind":"animal","hp":832,"atk":69,"defen":6,"spd":16,"level":30,"exp":205,"slash":3,"impact":4,"pierce":2,"magic":2,"fire":2,"ice":2,"light":1,"ail":3,"item_set":[{"id":"island-fish-fin","name":{"en":"Island Fish Fin","ja":"島魚のヒレ","tc":"島魚魚鰭","sc":"岛鱼鱼鳍"}},{"id":"beast-meat","name":{"en":"Beast Meat","ja":"ケモノ肉","tc":"野獸之肉","sc":"野兽之肉"}},{"id":"pretty-shell","name":{"en":"Pretty Shell","ja":"きれいな貝殻","tc":"美麗貝殼","sc":"美丽贝壳"}},{"id":"wascher","name":{"en":"Wascher","ja":"ワッシャー","tc":"哇沙魚","sc":"哇沙鱼"}},{"id":"butterfly-fish","name":{"en":"Butterfly Fish","ja":"チョウチョウウオ","tc":"蝴蝶魚","sc":"蝴蝶鱼"}},{"id":"camber","name":{"en":"Camber","ja":"カンバー","tc":"寒波魚","sc":"寒波鱼"}},{"id":"muschel","name":{"en":"Muschel","ja":"ムッシェル","tc":"螺貝","sc":"螺贝"}},{"id":"kriev","name":{"en":"Kriev","ja":"クリーヴ","tc":"巨箝","sc":"巨箝"}},{"id":"scissor-shrimp","name":{"en":"Scissor Shrimp","ja":"ハサミエビ","tc":"剪刀蝦","sc":"剪刀虾"}},{"id":"balloon-fish","name":{"en":"Balloon Fish","ja":"風船魚","tc":"氣球魚","sc":"气球鱼"}},{"id":"old-master","name":{"en":"Old Master","ja":"ぬし","tc":"領主","sc":"领主"}},{"id":"sunny-bird-staff","name":{"en":"Sunny Bird Staff","ja":"鳥と陽の杖","tc":"鳥與陽之杖","sc":"鸟与阳之杖"}},{"id":"metal-slasher","name":{"en":"Metal Slasher","ja":"メタルスラッシャー","tc":"金屬切割刀","sc":"金属切割刀"}},{"id":"steel-bow","name":{"en":"Steel Bow","ja":"鋼鉄弓","tc":"鋼鐵弓","sc":"钢铁弓"}},{"id":"night-lightning","name":{"en":"Night Lightning","ja":"ナイトライトニング","tc":"暗夜雷光","sc":"暗夜雷光"}},{"id":"beast-warding-shirt","name":{"en":"Beast War